   "desk": "visuals",
   "row": "screen seen_heard",
   "text": "Show each spoken key number or claim on screen at the moment it is said: put a big-number card or on-photo label with that exact figure under the line, and never leave a generic stock photo or an unrelated quote card over a number line.",
