   "desk": "visuals",
   "row": "screen readability",
   "text": "Never let a cutout, logo tile, stamp or caption overlap an article card's headline or subline: place the cutout in its own panel, crop each screenshot to the highlighted headline with no cut-off sentence at the bottom, and make that headline fill at least half the card width.",
