  {
   "id": "R7",
   "desk": "writer",
   "row": "script clarity",
   "text": "Make each segment end with a spoken handoff that links to the next story (for example 'Now, ...' or 'Next, ...'), and replace any aside that puts two nouns side by side (like 'settings runs') with a short plain sentence that reads clearly aloud.",
